SUMMARY:Chills\, Thrills and that Spooky Stuff: Horror of the Early '60s wi
 th Kevin Stairiker!
DESCRIPTION:What keeps you up at night? 🌙 Horror movies have been trying
  to crack that spooky code for over a century! Styles may change\, but a c
 lassic jump-scare can still creep out a fresh generation of moviegoers. 
 🎬 This October\, test your brave side with us! 🎃 Every Tuesday night
  starting at 6pm\, we’re screening legendary fright flicks that have giv
 en movie lovers the wiggles\, the willies\, and full-blown goosebumps for 
 decades. 🍿 Hosted by Kevin Stairiker (LNP | LancasterOnline)\, each eve
 ning packs in creepy cinema\, post-movie chats\, light snacks\, and maximu
 m eerie vibes. 🕷️ Bring your courage (and a friend to hide behind)! 
 👀✨ October 5th: City of the Dead\, 1960\, 78 minutes October 20th: Bl
 ack Sabbath\, 1963\, 93 minutes October 28th: The Innocents\, 1961\, 100 m
